            "created_at": "2025-07-07T22:29:32.228449+00:00",
            "notes": "- Now that you will likely have a decent amount of extra health from being this late in the game [Lifelift](item_641c3e2b-d652-4dc6-9ab9-1e5307b78325) is really going to help keep you alive and your charge running high\n\n- Sometimes with a [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49), if the shield is countering you past the recommendations below, consider [Here to Spot You](item_170b78de-4cbc-4b72-9efe-85ec58ac59ef); try to save up 2 bubbles at a time, then you can walk right past the [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) and keep your beam fixated on the closest squishy; then after a bubble to keep you alive while he swings on you, you can use your projected barrier on a teammate almost like a [Kiriko](hero_70a0ac5c-2a55-4fab-beeb-2f570886426f) teleport, go get back to safety in the middle of your team\n\n- If the other tank has lots of armor/shields like [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) or [Orisa](hero_91644d44-1093-4f62-ac51-020975465e85), start to mix in [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66); also consider a swap from [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) to [Codebreaker](item_caa96c7e-655f-4d03-9bd9-0f41937fec27)\n\n- If you're just taking too much damage through your bubbles at this point, consider swapping [Icy Coolant](item_8b1c21e9-33e8-49a6-8277-a3a06d55a65f) for [Crusader Hydraulics](item_b64cee07-ca32-405d-987e-868b415bbc09) and even [Bigger Beam](item_c29f5350-77e0-4bbb-a775-09bac9b10688) for [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8)\n\n- If you can't afford the recommended items that's ok, just swap around with what's in the optional items to get it as close as you can",
